 <h3><u>Suno Siffeen suno</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Suno siffin suno - 2<br> ABBAS AS HAIDER AS - 2<br> Suno Siffin suno - 2<br> Quran E shuja'at se mai yaseen sunaun,<br> Dil walo'n safe bandho mai siffin sunaun<br> Suno siffin suno. - 2</p> 
  <p>1) kya khaima E HAIDER AS me hai siffin ka manzar,<br> Jhurmut me sitaro'n k ek chand zami'n par,<br> HAIDER AS k pisar charo taraf beech me HAIDER AS,<br> Ye dekh k hairan the Khud MALIK E ASHTAR ,<br> Ayina e noor ek sabhi aks e jali hain,<br> MOLA AS kise bolun k yha sare ALI AS hain.<br> Suno siffin suno - 2</p> 
  <p>2) Beto se mukhatib hua IMRAN AS ka beta,<br> Dil mujhse ye kehta hai mera ay&nbsp; bani&nbsp; ZAHRA SA,<br> Yani ye hai KHALIQ k irade ka irada,<br> Maida'n me lade aaj koi beta ALI AS ka ,<br> Khul jaye k waliyo'n ka wali ladta hai kaise,<br> Mai bhi to zara dekhun ALI AS ladta hai kaise.<br> Suno siffin suno - 2</p> 
  <p>3) Ik goshe se sun kar ye utha ek dilawar,<br> Qad 13 baras me ABUTALIB AS k barabar,<br> Surat me ALI AS HAMZA sifat azm me JAFER ,<br> Sar taba qadam qudrat E MABOOD ka paikar,<br> ZEHRA SA ki sada ayi k almas ladega,<br> HASSNAIN AS k Baba mera ABBAS AS ladega.<br> Suno siffin suno. - 4</p> 
  <p>4) Goya hua phir dast E adab jod k zaigham,<br> AY mahram E asrar E KHUDA KHALIQ E Adam,<br> Hasrat hai hamari bhi ladayi ye laden hum,<br> Wada raha ye apse ay KHALIQ E Adam,<br> ZEHRA SA ki duao'n ka aqqaas na kehna,<br> Dushman na ALI AS keh de to ABBAS AS na kehna.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>5) Saj ban gaya khaime me jo HAIDER AS ka dulara,<br> Sadqa mere GHAZI AS ka wafao'n ne utara,<br> Chehre pe naqaab aap ye karta tha ishara,<br> Tarikh ne phir dekha kahan aisa nazara,<br> Parde me kuch is tarha se ABBAS AS E jari the,<br> Jaise pas E parda shab E meraj ALI AS the.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>6) Khaime se baramad hua HAIDER AS ka Gazanfar,<br> Ggaiz O ghazab O rob jalaal aye&nbsp; ghazab par,<br> Tayyar nazar aya jo lashkar pas E lashkar,<br> JIBREEL AS ne dum nad E ALI AS kar li paro par,<br> Haibat thi-2<br> Ajab sans farishto'n k chadhe the,<br> Khud maut se chip kar Malakun Maut khade the.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>7) Kis sher ka maida'n me utarta hai jigarban,<br> Aada pe kia Maut ne har zeest ka Dar band,<br> Munh khole hain hairat zabane hain Magar band,<br> Lashkar hua nazro me dilawar ki nazar band,<br> Tauba ka na dar REHMAT E AALAM ka khula hai,<br> Sab band hain bas rasta jahannum ka khula hai.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>8) Jis simt chala tegh uthaye wo bahadur,<br> Sab taayir E arwah ude Jism se phur-phur,<br> Dehshat se tha har ek guru goore hue gur,<br> Tha tegh ki jhankar me pancham ka ajab sur,<br> Awaaz yahi ahle dagha dete the bhago,<br> Sab raag pahadi me sada dete the bhago.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>9) Ek baar kia sher ne hamla jo jhapat kar,<br> Patto ki tarah Jism ki shakho'n se gire sar,<br> San San jo chali tegh ulatne lage lashkar,<br> Paigham ALI AS ka ye hawa ne diya aakar,<br> Are, Dil khol k lad lo na taraddud me raho tum,<br> ABBAS - 3 yahin rok dun suraj jo kaho tum.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>10) Talwar se Dar Dar k nidar bhag rahe the,<br> Thi Maut udhar ran me jidhar bhag rahe the,<br> Bhaga nahi jata tha magar Bhag rahe the,<br> Jaldi me wagar chod k sar bhag rahe the &nbsp;<br> Saans un k ruke the k jo maida'n me ruke the,<br> Zindo ki ye haalat thi ki murdo'n me chupe the.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>11) Kehti thi ajal dasht se be Jaan sameto,<br> Ye hath ye sar Jism ye dandan sameto,<br> Ay zakhmiyo'n bikhre hue ausaan sameto,<br> Ghar jao meri maan lo samaan sameto,<br> Marte ho&nbsp; jawani me ajab zauq hai tumko,<br> Kya Khud kushi karne ka bahot shouq hai tumko.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>12) Tarikh sunati hai ye siffin ka qissa,<br> Maida'n me jo aaye pisar aane bin e shasaa'n,<br> Nagin k sapole the magar wah re hamla,<br> MUSA ki asa ki tarha sab kha gaya naiza,<br> Sato'n pe buzurgo k sabaq kar diye roshan,<br> Do aise kiye chaudah tabaq kar diye roshan.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>13) Dil me yahi kehta raha SARWAR AS ka ALAMDAR ,<br> Phir mouqa mile YA na mile ay meri Talwar,<br> Tez or zara tez zara tez ho raftar,<br> Ay kash na roke mujhe ab HAIDER E KARRAR AS,<br> Haq kardun ada FATEMA ZAHRA SA k namak ka,<br> Are, badla&nbsp; abhi&nbsp; lelunga mai in sab se fidak ka.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>13) Maida'n se utha shor ALI AS hai ye ALI AS hai,<br> Kehte the fidak khor ALI AS hai ye ALI AS hai,<br> Bole ye labe gor  ALI AS hai ye ALI AS hai,<br> Are,&nbsp; bilkul hai Wahi zauq ALI AS hai ye ALI AS hai,<br> Sar uska udega jo bhala usse adega,<br> ALLAH ki taaqat se bhala kaun ladega.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>14) SHABBIR AS bhi Kehne lage kya khoob kia kaam,<br> Do hath me hi kar dia kuffar me kohram,<br> In hatho se hone hain abhi or bahot kaam,<br> Bhai hai tere waste Bhai ka ye in'aam,<br> Tu ayega ay sher palat kar jo hadaf se,<br> Mai hath dabaunga tere maa ki taraf se.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
  <p>15) HAIDER AS - 2 ne naqaab ake uthaya jo Takallum,<br> ABBAS AS k chehre pe nazar aya tabassum,<br> Baqi jo bache the wo hue Dekh k gum-sum,<br> MOLA AS ne kaha sham k laskhar se suno tum,<br> Ye FATEMA ZAHRA SA ki duao ka asar hai,<br> Pechan lo sab ye BANI HASHIM KA BHI QAMAR AS hai.<br> Suno siffin suno - 4</p> 
